/-!
# Checked generator leaves for every actual coverage label

The fixed family has the same label type as the geometric partition. Every
coordinate, radial enclosure, and numerical lower bound is established by the
ordinary kernel in its source block. All padding labels use the same actual
first rectangle as the geometric family.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace PartialBalayage.Maximal.Square

set_option maxRecDepth 32768
set_option maxHeartbeats 0

